            {
                "entry_id": "10669bf5-ecdb-33bf-848e-3caa3863f9fa",
                "word": "libertarisme",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "f47e16c3-5be9-4310-951f-76a05f603e3b",
                        "entry_id": "10669bf5-ecdb-33bf-848e-3caa3863f9fa",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "libertarismes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "028c0822-fca5-3eb6-9b8c-85bc22dc4ab2",
                        "entry_id": "10669bf5-ecdb-33bf-848e-3caa3863f9fa",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Doctrine des libertaires."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "27497dd2-b554-4686-88b0-190abc80730a",
                                "sense_id": "028c0822-fca5-3eb6-9b8c-85bc22dc4ab2",
                                "text": "Il y a assez longtemps qu’on épelle l’idée sociale, il serait temps de la dire couramment ; de la publier sans hésitation. Tâchons donc, une bonne fois, de nous défaire de ces réminiscences théistes et bourgeoises, d’oublier à jamais ce catéchisme politique et libéral que force nous a été de balbutier dans notre jeunesse, mais que nous devons désapprendre et désavouer à l’âge de raison. Opposons au libéralisme le libertarisme, au verbe politique l’incarnation sociale."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "760de09b-a0a0-4ecc-9605-01f430f5fef5",
                                "sense_id": "028c0822-fca5-3eb6-9b8c-85bc22dc4ab2",
                                "text": "Tous ces antiquaires-là, les rouges et les blancs, sont un peu compères et compagnons ; l’anarchie, le libertarisme, bouleverse leur misérable entendement, entendement encombré de préjugés ignares, de niaises vanités, de crétinisme."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4387242f-7097-4901-87fa-ae5e60b5b290",
                                "sense_id": "028c0822-fca5-3eb6-9b8c-85bc22dc4ab2",
                                "text": "Le libertarisme n’est pas facile à définir parce qu’il comporte plusieurs variantes de gauche et de droite."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d19aca8c-ed98-3606-9d65-0224c1c4bee6",
                        "entry_id": "10669bf5-ecdb-33bf-848e-3caa3863f9fa",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Libertarianisme pour sa variante défendant la propriété privée référence nécessaire (résoudre le problème)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "neologism"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3d82cdae-1bcc-474d-b75a-f0aad7e62ad3",
                        "source_entry_id": "10669bf5-ecdb-33bf-848e-3caa3863f9fa",
                        "target_lang_word": "libertarianism",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "libertarianism",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d51331c3-b40c-33c5-8be1-a76b5f8f3c09",
                                        "entry_id": "f0990d8a-d572-32cd-b6e0-a899f99474f6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A political philosophy maintaining that all persons are the absolute owners of their own lives, and should be free to do whatever they wish with their persons or property, provided they allow others that same liberty."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "00e96c84-996e-4b47-8e50-193e20a97014",
                                                "sense_id": "d51331c3-b40c-33c5-8be1-a76b5f8f3c09",
                                                "text": "Nevertheless, advocates of individual freedom not only continue to exist, but are increasing in number. Refugees from the Old Right, the Old Left and the New Left, they are organizing independently under the New Right banner of libertarianism."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d36ea492-ec32-4e99-8f18-a6f9fa123554",
                                                "sense_id": "d51331c3-b40c-33c5-8be1-a76b5f8f3c09",
                                                "text": "The peculiar brand of libertarianism in vogue within technology circles means a minority of members—a couple of outspoken misogynists—can disproportionately affect the behavior and mood of the group under the cover of free speech."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "29a497dc-ebbc-4554-8d3c-2d480d2be825",
                                                "sense_id": "d51331c3-b40c-33c5-8be1-a76b5f8f3c09",
                                                "text": "Isaacson reports that Musk’s fractured relationship with Jenna, who is trans, partly led to Musk’s rightward turn toward libertarianism and questioning what he considers the “woke-mind-virus, which is fundamentally antiscience, antimerit, and antihuman.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4a3922b7-b443-3d69-9367-007629143a75",
                                        "entry_id": "f0990d8a-d572-32cd-b6e0-a899f99474f6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The doctrine of free will, as opposed to necessitarianism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
